{
  "_comment": [
    "Firebase: Hosting + Storage for delivery/images; Auth + Firestore for user",
    "profiles only (name, email, uid). Seafood domain facts stay in PostgreSQL",
    "via FastAPI — never write WWF/prices/recipes into Firestore.",
    "",
    "Hosting serves the Flutter web build and proxies /api/** to the FastAPI",
    "service on Cloud Run, so the client makes same-origin requests and needs no",
    "CORS exemption in production.",
    "",
    "Deploy:  flutter build web --release  (in frontend/)  then  firebase deploy"
  ],
  "hosting": {
    "public": "frontend/build/web",
    "ignore": [
      "firebase.json",
      "**/.*",
      "**/node_modules/**"
    ],
    "rewrites": [
      {
        "source": "/api/**",
        "run": {
          "serviceId": "sukaseafood-api",
          "region": "asia-southeast1"
        }
      },
      {
        "source": "**",
        "destination": "/index.html"
      }
    ],
    "headers": [
      {
        "source": "**/*.@(js|css|woff2)",
        "headers": [
          {
            "key": "Cache-Control",
            "value": "public, max-age=31536000, immutable"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source": "/index.html",
        "headers": [
          {
            "key": "Cache-Control",
            "value": "no-cache"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "storage": {
    "rules": "storage.rules"
  },
  "firestore": {
    "database": "(default)",
    "location": "asia-southeast1",
    "rules": "firestore.rules",
    "indexes": "firestore.indexes.json"
  }
}
